<title>USA: 3Com holders approve merger.</title>
<headline>3Com holders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>3Com Corp said its shareholders and those of U.S. Robotics Corp have approved their merger.</p>
<p>It said the merger is expected to close on Thursday, June 12, following the completion of necessary filings.</p>
</text>
